# Access rules for a mosquitto that serves ECCE clients over TCP (a central
# server, or the shared system broker). Every client authenticates, so %u
# is the account the broker verified, never anything the client wrote in a
# message.

# A user reads and writes only below their own name, session messages
# included (ecce/<user>/session/<host>_<display>/...).
pattern readwrite ecce/%u/#

# Machine registrations are site-wide: everyone may hear that one changed,
# only its owner may say so. A "pattern" line because "topic" lines above
# the first "user" line apply to anonymous clients only.
pattern read ecce/+/ecce_machreg_changed
